1
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:09,337
There's nothing Yoshikage
Kira despises more than

2
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:12,773
sticking out in a crowd or
being the center of attention.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:17,500
To think I'd suffer such a sickening
humiliation in front of total strangers.

4
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,320
What's going on?

5
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,360
Heart attack pilots itself?

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,071
How could it be ensnared?

7
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:29,537
I have no idea what's
causing this to happen,

8
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:32,117
but I have to reverse
it before it's too late.

9
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,957
How's it going down there, buddy?

10
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,157
Can we help you out?

11
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,097
You don't look like you're doing so good.

12
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:39,457
I can call your mama for you if you want.

13
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:40,420
How about it?

14
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,820
I'm just fine.

15
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,380
Now beat it.

16
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,520
Yo, did you catch what this dude said?

17
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,677
It looks like he had too much booze,

18
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:51,757
and now this sloppy drunk has
forgotten how to use his manners.

19
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,760
Yeah, you enjoying the buzz?

20
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,560
Nice suit you got there!

21
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:59,757
Me and my home dog just got
fired and we're flat broke.

22
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,717
The ladies ain't exactly lining up either,

23
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:04,624
so when I see broskies
like you, I get agitated!

24
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,420
Don't just lie there!

25
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,993
Would you look at that!

26
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,760
Your shoelaces are untied.

27
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,861
Let me take care of that for you.

28
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:20,080
What a knot!

29
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:22,849
Good luck getting them
suckers loose again!

30
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:44,860
Oh, shitballs, what the hell did that?

31
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:50,840
It was a bomb made by my stand's power,
and that was Deadly Queen's Bomb Type 1.

32
00:01:52,140 --> 00:01:53,846
What are you doing, you fool?

33
00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:56,480
Today has been a complete disaster.

34
00:01:56,900 --> 00:02:01,120
All Yoshikage Kira wanted to do
was live a simple, quiet life.

35
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:03,857
But those meddling
maggots just had to stick

36
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:06,646
their wretched noses
where they didn't belong.

37
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:40,440
Thank you.

38
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:57,797
I always chase you, I always chase you.

39
00:02:57,880 --> 00:02:59,497
I don't want to run away.

40
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:04,277
I always chase you, I always chase you.

41
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:07,180
I'll do it again!

42
00:03:07,780 --> 00:03:12,737
The future is the end,

43
00:03:12,820 --> 00:03:15,440
so I chase you.

44
00:03:24,020 --> 00:03:25,237
What happened at that shoe shop?

45
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,437
I'm still kind of confused.

46
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:29,917
Koichi couldn't really explain it over
the phone, but it didn't sound good.

47
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,830
Let's hurry.

48
00:03:30,913 --> 00:03:33,369
It'll take about five
minutes to get there.

49
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,900
You managed to crack it.

50
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:41,397
And if the bomb stand took damage, then
its user just got a nasty surprise too.

51
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:43,857
Please do not venture
too far from my side.

52
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:46,587
And so you're aware, my
range is five meters.

53
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,340
I can see this comes as a shock to you.

54
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:51,877
Make no mistake, we've indeed matured.

55
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:54,157
Our power is much greater than before.

56
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:58,534
My inferior range in comparison with
Act 2 is an unavoidable shortcoming.

57
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:03,917
Moving outside my 5 meter range removes
the weight applied to the target object.

58
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,880
If it does so,

59
00:04:05,060 --> 00:04:07,157
the target will be excited
to such a degree that

60
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,817
it will rush toward us
like an animal in heat.

61
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:12,597
Conversely, if your aim
is to pin the target down,

62
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:16,657
moving closer will exponentially increase
the amount of force applied to it.

63
00:04:16,740 --> 00:04:18,300
So what's it going to be?

64
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,190
Neither.

65
00:04:20,273 --> 00:04:21,904
For now I want him right there.

66
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:25,378
I just hope Josuke gets here
before Trouble shows up.

67
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:55,940
You know, I hear a new gym is getting
ready to open near Budogaoka High School.

68
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:59,336
And given today's events,
I'm now considering joining.

69
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:02,040
I should probably build up my strength.

70
00:05:02,660 --> 00:05:05,460
Then again, I haven't
had the best luck lately.

71
00:05:05,740 --> 00:05:09,877
I could end up sharing weights with or
swimming in the same pool as the dregs?

72
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:12,666
who'd rather play with
their dicks than bathe.

73
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:17,300
It took me a total of
three minutes to get here.

74
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:22,780
I realized the full extent of my weakness
as I tried to traverse the crosswalk.

75
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,260
Question for you.

76
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:28,913
How many guests should I be
expecting to join this party?

77
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,390
What?

78
00:05:30,473 --> 00:05:32,872
You phone someone asking for help, right?

79
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:36,097
Josuke Higashikata and
Okuyasu Nijimura are closest,

80
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,857
and being about five minutes away,

81
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:40,097
I'd wager they have two minutes to go.

82
00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:42,237
You're one of their best
friends, are you not?

83
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,150
Wait.

84
00:05:43,233 --> 00:05:45,557
Yukako Yamagishi and that
haughty woman who runs

85
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:49,160
Beauty Institute Cinderella
are stand users as well, right?

86
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:53,337
Though I severely doubt you'd turn to
them for help in your hour of need.

87
00:05:53,420 --> 00:05:54,600
You're the killer!

88
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:59,460
In all the confusion, I
misplaced my other jacket.

89
00:06:00,140 --> 00:06:02,460
No matter, I'll retrieve it later.

90
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:05,880
But first, I must do away with you.

91
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:07,180
I was right!

92
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:09,137
You're the man we're all after!

93
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:10,279
You're the killer!

94
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:13,395
Year after year, you've killed people.

95
00:06:13,780 --> 00:06:15,880
I doubt you even remember them all.

96
00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:19,140
Reimi? Shigechi?

97
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:21,590
Shigechi?

98
00:06:23,420 --> 00:06:25,140
Make him suffer, Act Three!

99
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,280
Deadly Queen.

100
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,780
That's so not fair!

101
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:40,577
Why does this guy have two stands?

102
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:42,757
I thought a user could only possess one!

103
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:45,140
While Deadly Queen is my actual stand,

104
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:48,957
Heart Attack is a smart bomb which
I launch from the stand's left hand.

105
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:53,216
That's why the damage I've received
has been contained to my left hand.

106
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:55,620
Before we proceed, Master Koichi,

107
00:06:55,900 --> 00:06:59,857
you should know that you've just left
the parameters of the 5-meter range.

108
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:02,999
The force suppressing his
bomb stand will dissipate.

109
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:05,950
Finally.

110
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:08,200
S-H-I-T.

111
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:12,205
Since it has escaped, I will have
to initiate three frees again.

112
00:07:12,660 --> 00:07:13,601
How interesting.

113
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,565
Your stand's range is limited.

114
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:19,377
Which of them shall be
the target of my attack?

115
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:22,578
The actual murderer or that
piece-of-shit bomb stand?

116
00:07:24,580 --> 00:07:28,874
Unfortunately, Master, three frees
cannot weigh down two targets at once.

117
00:07:29,260 --> 00:07:31,084
Even if we immobilize the user,

118
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:33,857
the bomb stand will just keep
charging at us on autopilot.

119
00:07:33,940 --> 00:07:37,469
But if we stop the bomb, the
user will rush in for the kill.

120
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,700
Which will it be, sir?

121
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:44,253
I need your orders before it's too late.

122
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:48,241
To whom shall I direct my attack?

123
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,546
Find your target is the bomb!

124
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,600
Free! Freeze!

125
00:07:58,940 --> 00:07:59,770
Goodness.

126
00:07:59,900 --> 00:08:01,100
A valiant effort,

127
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:03,257
but it appears you were
destined for defeat

128
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:05,737
no matter which of us
you decided to target.

129
00:08:05,820 --> 00:08:09,077
I used to think Heart Attack was
my invincible ace in the hole.

130
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:12,748
I never imagined it would be
rendered completely ineffective.

131
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,540
What a day.

132
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:18,760
I had to compensate a cafe, and
then I had a run-in with some thugs.

133
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:21,457
Truthfully, I feel like
I've been taken for a ride.

134
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:23,040
This is a first for me.

135
00:08:23,180 --> 00:08:25,817
Never have I been so
challenged in such a way.

136
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:29,782
In fact, I've been left with a
slight taste of defeat in my mouth.

137
00:08:30,020 --> 00:08:33,255
Well, you've certainly earned
my deepest respects, boy.

138
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,400
You really are something else.

139
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:41,496
By the way, you wouldn't happen to
have any tissues on hand, would you?

140
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:43,520
A handkerchief would also do.

141
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,300
What is this?

142
00:08:45,420 --> 00:08:48,057
I've gone out of my way
to pay you my respects.

143
00:08:48,140 --> 00:08:50,557
The least you could do
was converse with me.

144
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:52,260
I don't have any.

145
00:08:52,780 --> 00:08:53,660
No worries.

146
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,374
Feel free to use mine.

147
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:01,493
Quickly now, your nose is gushing blood.

148
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:04,237
I offered it so you
could clean yourself up.

149
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,849
I'm about to beat you
into a bloody puddle.

150
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:11,060
And in just over a minute, your
friends will arrive to find nothing.

151
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:14,122
Leaving you alive just
doesn't sit right with me.

152
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:17,341
Especially after the public
humiliation I endured.

153
00:09:19,060 --> 00:09:20,840
Oh, put a sock in it.

154
00:09:21,060 --> 00:09:23,413
Better yet, why not take the whole foot?

155
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:27,457
This day has gifted me with the
exact same pain you're feeling now.

156
00:09:27,540 --> 00:09:28,370
However,

157
00:09:28,453 --> 00:09:33,060
I accepted it with grace as opposed to
your tedious whining, you mewling Cameo.

158
00:09:34,940 --> 00:09:37,900
Sit back and watch a real man work.

159
00:09:40,540 --> 00:09:41,370
See?

160
00:09:41,453 --> 00:09:43,460
Tissues come in handy, don't they?

161
00:09:44,620 --> 00:09:45,620
Here, let me.

162
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:50,351
Blood or otherwise, they say a stuffy
nose is a sure path to slow cognition.

163
00:09:50,660 --> 00:09:52,340
If it's any consolation,

164
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:56,360
not too long ago, I was groveling
on the ground just like you.

165
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:59,958
In one minute, I will vaporize
you with Deadly Queen.

166
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:04,900
Until then, why don't you learn from
yours truly and put up with the pain?

167
00:10:05,180 --> 00:10:07,768
Learn to be tough in
the face of resistance!

168
00:10:15,900 --> 00:10:17,200
What do you know?

169
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,237
Your name is...

170
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,780
is Yoshikage Kira!

171
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:25,000
You look surprised.

172
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:27,880
All I did was say your name, Kira.

173
00:10:31,540 --> 00:10:33,775
You gotta look at my driver's license,

174
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:36,357
but when did you have the
chance to bill for my wallet?

175
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,177
you pathetic little bootlicker?

176
00:10:38,260 --> 00:10:40,084
Don't tell me you've forgotten.

177
00:10:40,460 --> 00:10:42,380
You reimbursed the cafe.

178
00:10:43,460 --> 00:10:46,636
You couldn't have given me
a better clue if I'd asked.

179
00:10:46,980 --> 00:10:49,098
I don't see how the two are related.

180
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:51,897
Regardless, learning my name
now does you a little good.

181
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:54,686
In a matter of moments,
you'll cease to exist.

182
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:59,148
Yeah, believe me, I know all
too well what's about to happen.

183
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:03,657
But even so, if a pathetic bootlicker like
me can figure out your name that easily,

184
00:11:03,740 --> 00:11:07,093
I guess you're not as tough
as you seem to think you are.

185
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:11,217
Sure, you might get away for the
time being, but you know what, Kira?

186
00:11:11,300 --> 00:11:13,917
I bet your every thought
is mocking me for letting

187
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:16,706
a whiny brat unravel the
mystery of your name.

188
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:19,737
And if they aren't, I'll
do the honors for them.

189
00:11:19,820 --> 00:11:22,761
A mewling little high
School just found you out.

190
00:11:23,380 --> 00:11:25,560
You're such a colossal dumbass!

191
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:29,377
I'll be waiting for you on the other
side, you murder-happy son of a bitch!

192
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:30,380
That's enough!

193
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,727
That's the end of that brat.

194
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:38,500
But damn him, why do I feel like I lost?

195
00:11:48,820 --> 00:11:50,620
What an infuriating pest.

196
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:55,684
I let him provoke me, but I still have a
minute before Josuke and Okuyasu show up.

197
00:11:57,520 --> 00:12:01,017
I thought roughing the boy up
would settle my turbulent spirit,

198
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:03,159
but I can't say I feel much better.

199
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,310
Huh?

200
00:12:04,393 --> 00:12:06,647
Why would he be wearing
his socks inside out?

201
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:08,585
I guess it doesn't bother him.

202
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:14,970
No!

203
00:12:15,053 --> 00:12:16,180
I can't stand it!

204
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:21,840
That's the wrong way!

205
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:23,537
But the shoe store is this way!

206
00:12:23,620 --> 00:12:25,377
This path will get us there faster!

207
00:12:25,460 --> 00:12:26,290
Hurry!

208
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:32,460
Put your damn socks on right!

209
00:12:37,740 --> 00:12:39,697
That gnawing unease is gone.

210
00:12:39,780 --> 00:12:43,740
Which means it's time to eradicate
you like the bug you are!

211
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:44,800
Deadly queen!

212
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:49,497
The tip of this figure can transform
anything it touches into a bomb.

213
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:53,874
So for your execution, I think I'll
have it transform your student badge.

214
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,020
Bomb type one!

215
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:01,842
You did a good job holding
down the fork, Koichi.

216
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:03,660
I'll take it from here.

217
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:07,350
What?!

218
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:15,680
This is a shock.

219
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:19,177
I didn't think you'd be able to prop
yourself up with those injuries.

220
00:13:19,260 --> 00:13:21,157
You would have been
better off entering your

221
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:23,652
eternal slumber peacefully on the ground.

222
00:13:23,940 --> 00:13:28,469
I'm fairly certain I can see the trees
behind you through your gaping wounds.

223
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:31,160
Nice watch. Huh?

224
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:35,896
Go ahead and take one last look at
it, because I'm about to bust it up.

225
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:38,820
To be clear, by it, I mean your face.

226
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:42,600
You certainly are an
intriguing individual.

227
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:45,937
I would love to learn your
name, among other things,

228
00:13:46,020 --> 00:13:49,138
but I really must mosey
along to my next destination.

229
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,560
I have a mere 20 seconds left.

230
00:13:52,740 --> 00:13:55,520
Mindless small talk just
isn't on the agenda.

231
00:13:59,300 --> 00:14:01,197
I have to be honest with you.

232
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:03,751
Your stans attack was surprisingly feeble.

233
00:14:03,980 --> 00:14:07,477
Stopping that pitiful punch was
like catching a little pup fly.

234
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:10,177
You'd have to be an absolute
Neanderthal to believe your

235
00:14:10,260 --> 00:14:13,848
feebleness has any chance of
overcoming Deadly Queen's power.

236
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:24,700
What the hell?

237
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:26,351
How can you move so fast?

238
00:14:26,660 --> 00:14:28,800
Good freaking grief. I take it back.

239
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:31,256
Up close that watch is tacky as hell.

240
00:14:31,460 --> 00:14:35,057
Although to be fair, I'd say that's
the least of your worries now.

241
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:38,737
Well, there's something that's going to
look a lot worse than that piece of junk.

242
00:14:38,820 --> 00:14:41,232
And that, my friend, is your putrid face.

243
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:53,080
What is this, Dan?

244
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:56,874
It's so fast, it's like the
damn thing has stopped time!

245
00:15:05,900 --> 00:15:10,488
Koichi, if you hadn't stepped up the way
you did, I would have been long dead.

246
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:14,273
Even all alone, you fought
valiantly right up to the end.

247
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:17,140
There's no doubt about it, you've matured.

248
00:15:18,340 --> 00:15:19,820
You have my respect.

249
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,740
Hey, Koichi! Koichi!

250
00:15:38,420 --> 00:15:39,340
Oh no!

251
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:40,917
Did we get here too late?

252
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:41,830
What happened?

253
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:46,300
Hey, Koichi!

254
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:47,860
Jotaro, hang on!

255
00:15:49,220 --> 00:15:54,997
Eyes open Okuyasu yeah sure but what
the hell how'd they get so messed

256
00:15:55,080 --> 00:16:00,417
up calm down we have to find out if
they're still alive if they are i can

257
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:06,377
heal them with shining diamond yes
jotaro's alive but he's barely clinging

258
00:16:06,460 --> 00:16:11,720
to life koichi is too but he's not
breathing you gotta hurry up and heal

259
00:16:12,380 --> 00:16:13,210
him, Josuke!

260
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:15,638
He's not gonna make it at this rate!

261
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,177
I can't believe it.

262
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:18,800
Josuke and Okuyasu

263
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:21,190
are here.

264
00:16:21,273 --> 00:16:23,880
This is the worst day
I've ever lived through.

265
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,520
It's been one disaster after another.

266
00:16:29,540 --> 00:16:31,817
Yoshikage Kira has always been able to

267
00:16:31,900 --> 00:16:34,760
overcome any obstacle
that's gotten in his way.

268
00:16:34,980 --> 00:16:35,810
And

269
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:38,157
I'll get out of this mess as well.

270
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,340
I must!

271
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:40,716
Where are you going?

272
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:42,840
Look at him.

273
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,097
He got beat to shit.

274
00:16:44,180 --> 00:16:49,120
Listen, turn around and don't try
anything funny. You got it? What's wrong?

275
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:50,777
Didn't you hear what he said?

276
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:52,120
Show us your face!

277
00:16:55,520 --> 00:16:56,760
Be careful, you two!

278
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:59,357
You have to stay far away
from Mukadeya's shoes!

279
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:02,680
Another crazy explosion
might go off! Get to safety!

280
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:05,817
The first one came out of nowhere
and blew the owner to pieces!

281
00:17:05,900 --> 00:17:07,724
They were caught up in it, too!

282
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:09,630
An explosion?

283
00:17:09,713 --> 00:17:11,360
Hey, just calm down.

284
00:17:11,700 --> 00:17:13,237
Were you also in the blast?

285
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:17,240
I'm an office worker who was
nearby, but now I'm going to die!

286
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:20,137
I'm losing way too much blood!

287
00:17:20,220 --> 00:17:21,160
Why me?

288
00:17:21,660 --> 00:17:23,660
Hey, come on, man. Calm down.

289
00:17:23,900 --> 00:17:25,077
It's gonna be alright.

290
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,925
I can heal you, lickety-split.

291
00:17:27,860 --> 00:17:30,272
Alright, now tell me where it hurts most.

292
00:17:30,380 --> 00:17:31,480
My midsection!

293
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:34,839
I think one of my rips might
have punctured my lung!

294
00:17:36,820 --> 00:17:39,020
Please, hurry and save me!

295
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,640
Pretty, huh? That's weird.

296
00:17:41,940 --> 00:17:45,577
Last time I checked, I looked like I was
just an ordinary high school student.

297
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:48,189
Yet you believed I
could treat your wounds.

298
00:17:49,020 --> 00:17:52,337
I still have trouble getting people
to let me into pachinko parlors,

299
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:54,797
but somehow I strike you
as a med school graduate

300
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:57,297
ready and willing to fix
your little boo-boos?

301
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:58,210
Huh?

302
00:17:59,540 --> 00:18:01,300
You totally took the bait,

303
00:18:01,500 --> 00:18:04,937
which means you have the ability
to see my shining diamond.

304
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:05,850
Crap!

305
00:18:05,933 --> 00:18:06,900
I got too excited!

306
00:18:07,580 --> 00:18:12,060
That must make you the killer we're
after and they are your would-be victims

307
00:18:14,660 --> 00:18:16,320
Wait, are you serious?

308
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:17,701
He's the killer?

309
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:22,700
It seems you finally hunted
down your culprit. You're right.

310
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:27,037
I'm the one you've been looking for
Morio's resident killer You know

311
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:32,277
my identity the true nature of my
stand you even know my real name?

312
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:36,400
I suppose sleeping like a baby
isn't really in the cards for me!

313
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:39,340
But it's just a temporary setback.

314
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:40,920
Deadly Queen!

315
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,837
What the hell do you think you're doing?

316
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:53,460
What does it look like I severed my hand?

317
00:18:53,660 --> 00:18:56,954
It's so excruciating, it's a
wonder I'm still conscious.

318
00:18:57,320 --> 00:19:00,496
There's so much blood, look
at me, I'm a sobbing mess.

319
00:19:00,900 --> 00:19:03,937
Victory and defeat mean
absolutely nothing to me, kiddos.

320
00:19:04,020 --> 00:19:05,640
I assure you I'll survive.

321
00:19:05,900 --> 00:19:08,057
I'll live on in peaceful tranquility.

322
00:19:08,140 --> 00:19:10,037
It's true I'll have to
live out the rest of

323
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:12,417
my days with the
insatiable desire to kill.

324
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:15,265
But make no mistake, I'll
have my happy ending.

325
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:17,780
I hereby free you, heart attack.

326
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:19,660
You may act as you see fit.

327
00:19:19,820 --> 00:19:22,040
Your final duty is to protect me.

328
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,380
You're kidding me!

329
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:25,997
What is this toy gonna do?

330
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:29,697
Josuke, that's a remote bomb stand
set to go after thermal energy.

331
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:31,517
The thing is completely indestructible.

332
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:34,776
If it hits you, your body
temperature will set it off!

333
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:39,735
Shining diamond can't break the thing!

334
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:42,210
Break it?

335
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:46,255
Why the hell would I do that
when I can fix it instead?

336
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:49,048
He was kind enough to
leave his hand behind.

337
00:19:51,900 --> 00:19:53,737
It's not the prettiest sight to look at,

338
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:55,897
but that hand is leading
us to our murderer.

339
00:19:55,980 --> 00:19:57,137
Let's go! Yeah!

340
00:19:57,220 --> 00:20:01,580
YOU'RE NOT GETTING AWAY FROM US
THAT EASILY, YOU FREAKING PSYCHO!

341
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:05,340
Hey, you girls seeing this?

342
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:12,560
Mark my words, I'll do whatever it
takes to sleep peacefully again.

343
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,300
Kira, what happened?

344
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:17,277
Why is your face caked in blood?

345
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:18,260
Hi, everyone.

346
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,562
Is it time to head home already?

347
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,680
Sorry, but I'm in a hurry.

348
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:24,820
See you around.

349
00:20:27,220 --> 00:20:29,680
The murderer's name is Yoshikage Kira.

350
00:20:29,940 --> 00:20:32,760
His address is Mariah Kotodai 1128.

351
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:34,420
He's 33 years old.

352
00:20:34,580 --> 00:20:37,917
Also, he wields a short-range
bomb stand called Deadly Queen.

353
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:39,360
Just look at it go!

354
00:20:39,580 --> 00:20:41,217
Where's this guy running to?

355
00:20:41,300 --> 00:20:43,257
It doesn't matter where he's going.

356
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:44,987
When we find him, he's dead.

357
00:20:47,660 --> 00:20:49,484
He's holed up in this building.

358
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:51,100
Guys, wait a second.

359
00:20:51,380 --> 00:20:52,237
Isn't this...

360
00:20:52,320 --> 00:20:54,180
Beauty Institute Cinderella?

361
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:57,864
Why the hell would he
come to a place like this?

362
00:20:59,260 --> 00:21:01,200
Oh no! Dr. Aya!

363
00:21:02,120 --> 00:21:03,420
Aya, are you in here?

364
00:21:18,640 --> 00:21:20,037
Dr. Aya! She's...

365
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:21,940
No way! It can't be!

366
00:21:22,820 --> 00:21:24,937
The hell did she do to deserve this?

367
00:21:25,020 --> 00:21:25,961
Look over there.

368
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:27,960
It's Yoshikage Kira.

369
00:21:28,260 --> 00:21:29,240
He's dead.

370
00:21:30,140 --> 00:21:30,970
Hiya!

371
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:32,480
This is awful.

372
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:35,311
What the hell could have happened in here?

373
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:41,540
Wait, that man isn't Yoshikage Kira.

374
00:21:41,740 --> 00:21:42,860
He's got two hands.

375
00:21:46,620 --> 00:21:49,780
Holy shit, his face is missing. What?

376
00:21:50,080 --> 00:21:51,800
His fingerprints are too.

377
00:21:51,940 --> 00:21:53,220
That's so weird.

378
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,341
Who is this guy?

379
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:59,560
He has the same height
and belt as the murderer.

380
00:22:01,180 --> 00:22:07,220
That monster brought him here and murdered
the poor man right before my eyes.

381
00:22:07,780 --> 00:22:10,260
He's more ghastly than I imagined.

382
00:22:10,940 --> 00:22:14,017
He forced me to use Cinderella to replace

383
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:17,580
his face as well as his
hair and fingerprints.

384
00:22:18,060 --> 00:22:20,589
Wait, are you saying
he's someone else now?

385
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:21,777
That's right.

386
00:22:21,860 --> 00:22:23,560
His new face.

387
00:22:24,020 --> 00:22:25,020
Shining diamonds!

388
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:26,900
His face.

389
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:30,140
No, Josuke, don't touch her.

390
00:22:30,380 --> 00:22:31,498
Get back right now!

391
00:22:32,600 --> 00:22:33,600
His face.

392
00:22:40,700 --> 00:22:41,530
Kaya!

393
00:22:44,620 --> 00:22:46,657
He's on the other side of that door.

394
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:47,681
He won't escape!

395
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:53,280
Oh, you're joking!

396
00:22:59,320 --> 00:23:00,720
Everyone's going home!

397
00:23:01,420 --> 00:23:02,960
There are so many!

398
00:23:03,300 --> 00:23:04,540
But which one is he?

399
00:23:04,860 --> 00:23:07,331
Which one of these guys is Yoshikage Kira?

400
00:23:09,060 --> 00:23:10,380
Yoshikage Kira!

401
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:12,280
You gutless prick!

402
00:23:12,540 --> 00:23:14,420
Come out here and face us!

403
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:17,020
So he managed to slip away.

404
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:20,935
With his new face he'll have
no reason to fear or hide.

405
00:23:21,060 --> 00:23:23,777
You can bet your ass he'll
stay right here in Morioh,

406
00:23:23,860 --> 00:23:26,440
and go on living just as he always has.

407
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:28,380
Aya Tsuji deceased.

408
00:23:29,040 --> 00:23:33,864
Yoshikage Kira has changed his face, name,
and address and assumed a new identity.
